; Regression test for issue #2057: C 1 "" = 1 € crashed the balance
; report, which followed the euro's link to a bare amount and read the
; commodity that amount lacks.  A conversion needs a commodity on each
; side, so since issue #3261 the directive is rejected and that link is
; never made.

C 1 "" = 1 $

2021-01-01 Test
    A               $10
    B

test bal -> 1
__ERROR__
While parsing file "$FILE", line 7:
Error: Commodity conversion requires a commodity on each side
end test
